flowchart LR
    A[Read permitted data] --> B[Create proposed action]
    B --> C[Show exact target and change]
    C --> D{Required approval received}
    D -->|No| E[Keep as proposal]
    D -->|Yes| F[Check approval is current]
    F -->|Missing or expired| E
    F -->|Current| G[Execute once]
    G --> H[Verify independently]
    H -->|Matches proposal| I[Complete]
    H -->|Mismatch or uncertain| J[Stop and investigate]